~Troubleshooting

~    I dont want to be red anymore.

~    I want to play someone else.

~    I want to go first always.

~    I am addicted to the game.

~    I dont know which move to make, help me decide!

~    I am too good, who else can I play?

~    The sound is really bugging me, can I turn it off?

~    The computer is too slow, can I speed it up?

~    The computer is too fast, can I slow it down?

~    I am totally undefeated, the game is no challenge.
Try changing some of the following :-
Player->Options->Goes First as Loser
Board->Custom->(Change the connect size). Higher levels of
    connection are harder to obtain.
Board->Custom->(Change the row or column size). Different
    boards can have different strategies.
Play a human. Humans are better in some areas of strategy
than AI's. Humans learn from their mistakes.
